  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Founder's Front Door",
    "overview": "This page is the person-first sibling of theseller.com.br/links. It reuses the same quiet, premium system the user built for the company page, and it opens on a large cut-out portrait of Marco Túlio where the company page shows the logo. The ground is a dark blue-black gradient lit by three slow cyan and blue blobs, heavily blurred. On it sit navy cards with soft 18px corners and a faint white hairline. Each card has a cyan icon tile at the left. Only one object on the page is loud: the cyan-to-blue gradient WhatsApp CTA, framed by a thin ring of light that rotates.\n\nThe column is narrow and phone-first (480px max). Poppins carries every title and DM Sans carries every reading line. Motion is slow and ambient. The blobs drift over 25 to 29 seconds, the CTA frame turns once every 6 seconds, and the identity block and cards rise in on load. The portrait comes first and fills the column; there is no small avatar anywhere in the system.\n\nThe user rejected the earlier \"Palco\" (stage) direction as not premium. Stage props, lower-thirds and textures are out.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
